## Issuance

- Path: {{issuancePath}}
- AIR Kit orchestrates SDK issuance via AIR issuer proxy routes; the issuer backend authorizes, creates/signs, encrypts and stores the VC.
- Direct issuance starts from a trusted backend event/job: `POST /auth/initialize-user` → issuer-side VC creation/signing/encryption → `POST /dstorage/vcs`.
- Issuer API keys and protected backend handlers stay server-side.

Documented AIR API bases: sandbox `https://api.sandbox.mocachain.org/v1`; production `https://mocachain-mainnet.api.air3.com/v1`.

